WEBVTT

00:19.920 --> 00:24.258
The wound inside my sealed memories

00:24.258 --> 00:28.929
When it silently touches the heart

00:28.929 --> 00:36.570
Tears of loneliness behind
the gentle smile

00:36.570 --> 00:41.442
I seek boundless strength

00:41.442 --> 00:52.252
I continue to run up with
what I believe in

00:52.252 --> 00:54.321
I want to protect

00:54.321 --> 00:56.590
I want to believe

00:56.590 --> 01:00.828
all the reasons for that smile

01:00.828 --> 01:05.265
The heat and the love

01:05.265 --> 01:09.497
I accept them all

01:09.536 --> 01:13.107
I won't let go of your hand again

01:13.107 --> 01:21.981
Aiming towards that light...

01:30.391 --> 01:34.020
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:37.598 --> 01:39.600
I sense a monster!

01:39.600 --> 01:41.591
East Third Palace!

01:42.102 --> 01:44.002
In Michinaga's house?

01:59.053 --> 02:01.214
Oh... I-I'm sorry!

02:02.990 --> 02:06.593
I-I'll call Grandfather later
and ask him to...

02:06.593 --> 02:09.229
set up a stronger
magical barrier,

02:09.229 --> 02:13.029
so no one will be able to
harm you, First Princess!

02:13.901 --> 02:17.004
It's Akiko! Don't call me
First Princess!

02:17.004 --> 02:18.904
I'm Akiko, Masahiro.

02:20.707 --> 02:23.870
Listen to the Frightened
Voice in the Dark

02:26.246 --> 02:29.149
Seiryou quarters and the inner
palace have burnt down.

02:29.149 --> 02:32.753
So it seems that the Emperor
has moved to the First Palace.

02:32.753 --> 02:34.653
That's right...

02:36.290 --> 02:39.293
The responsibility for repairing
the ruined inner palace...

02:39.293 --> 02:41.295
has apparently been
given to Yukinari.

02:41.295 --> 02:42.930
That's right...

02:42.930 --> 02:47.234
The palace guards conducted
investigations after the fire.

02:47.234 --> 02:51.038
But they were unable to
determine the cause.

02:51.038 --> 02:52.506
That's right...

02:52.506 --> 02:55.309
Hey, are you listening
to what I'm saying?

02:55.309 --> 02:56.833
That's right...

03:00.848 --> 03:04.113
That's right! I shouldn't
be doing this now!

03:06.053 --> 03:07.452
Really...

03:10.591 --> 03:21.968
[chant]

03:24.404 --> 03:28.204
Princess, you mustn't
open your eyes yet.

03:30.777 --> 03:32.745
A little while longer...

03:38.619 --> 03:41.188
Seimei, is it finished?

03:41.188 --> 03:43.590
Yes, Lord Michinaga.

03:43.590 --> 03:47.361
I have set up a stronger
magical barrier than before.

03:47.361 --> 03:49.897
However, we can't let
our guard down...

03:49.897 --> 03:52.092
since it has been
breached previously.

03:53.300 --> 03:57.430
Princess Akiko, as a
precaution, please take this.

03:59.239 --> 04:02.675
- What is this?
- It's a protection charm.

04:04.444 --> 04:07.147
Thank you very much,
Master Seimei.

04:07.147 --> 04:10.117
I think that Akiko should
be safe now...

04:10.117 --> 04:12.920
since you have done
so much for her.

04:12.920 --> 04:16.014
Besides, we have your
wonderful grandson too.

04:16.557 --> 04:18.792
Lord Michinaga,

04:18.792 --> 04:23.030
I think you could be
overestimating Masahiro a little.

04:23.030 --> 04:24.598
What do you mean?

04:24.598 --> 04:27.968
Masahiro was the only one
in the onmyou dorms...

04:27.968 --> 04:31.238
who sensed something
was wrong at that time.

04:31.238 --> 04:33.640
Everyone else was
probably distracted by...

04:33.640 --> 04:36.777
the commotion due to the fire
and failed to notice it.

04:36.777 --> 04:41.180
As expected of your
grandson, I'm impressed.

04:41.949 --> 04:44.918
- You are too kind.
- Master Seimei.

04:46.220 --> 04:48.121
Yes, what is the matter?

04:48.121 --> 04:51.525
Well, how is Masahiro?

04:51.525 --> 04:54.983
He's trying his best to find
out the cause of the fire.

04:57.664 --> 05:00.334
We can see the stars
very clearly tonight.

05:00.334 --> 05:04.204
It's a perfect night for
reading the stars, Masahiro.

05:04.204 --> 05:05.933
Yeah...

05:07.007 --> 05:10.272
What's wrong? Did you
find a suspicious star?

05:11.712 --> 05:14.982
What's been bothering you?

05:14.982 --> 05:18.819
Nothing. I'm just studying
how to read the stars.

05:18.819 --> 05:21.054
You're studying how
to read the stars?

05:21.054 --> 05:24.224
I'm not good at
reading the stars.

05:24.224 --> 05:26.893
You're bad at it?
But reading the stars...

05:26.893 --> 05:29.129
is basic knowledge
for an onmyouji!

05:29.129 --> 05:31.765
I guess I'm more suited
to running around...

05:31.765 --> 05:34.501
than reading the stars.

05:34.501 --> 05:38.005
But that's not good
for an onmyouji.

05:38.005 --> 05:40.941
But Mokkun,
think of it this way.

05:40.941 --> 05:45.612
What if the sky is cloudy
and the stars are not visible?

05:45.612 --> 05:47.614
And high above the clouds,

05:47.614 --> 05:51.618
a suspicious star which foretells
some disaster streaks by.

05:51.618 --> 05:53.820
It's possible, isn't it?

05:53.820 --> 05:56.516
That's just a quibble.

05:56.990 --> 06:01.328
It'll be unreasonable to blame
the onmyouji because of this.

06:01.328 --> 06:04.798
But this doesn't mean
you can be bad at it.

06:04.798 --> 06:08.702
- But...
- But it's a necessary skill.

06:08.702 --> 06:10.533
Come on, try harder!

06:11.538 --> 06:14.598
I'm bad at reading
the stars after all.

06:17.377 --> 06:20.480
- Where are you going?
- Just for a change in pace.

06:20.480 --> 06:22.778
Hey, take me with you.

06:39.099 --> 06:41.835
I thought it'd help if
I got a closer look...

06:41.835 --> 06:44.204
at the stars.
But it's no use at all.

06:44.204 --> 06:48.008
You can barely read the stars,
of course it's impossible.

06:48.008 --> 06:51.011
I'm really not suited for
the art of divination after all.

06:51.011 --> 06:54.242
How about asking
Seimei for his help?

06:58.285 --> 07:00.721
He's an onmyouji who
specializes in divination.

07:00.721 --> 07:03.490
- No way.
- That's what I thought.

07:03.490 --> 07:05.092
Because, Mokkun...

07:05.092 --> 07:08.929
If I go to my grandfather now,
what do you think will happen?

07:08.929 --> 07:12.999
What, Masahiro?! You can't
even read the stars?

07:12.999 --> 07:15.435
That's really pathetic.

07:15.435 --> 07:18.338
I need to teach you
all over again.

07:18.338 --> 07:21.007
Oh, but even so,
that's pathetic.

07:21.007 --> 07:22.476
That could happen.

07:22.476 --> 07:23.877
And he'll say...

07:23.877 --> 07:26.947
Masahiro, I tried
my best to teach you.

07:26.947 --> 07:31.318
But was it all a waste of effort?
Grandfather is so sad.

07:31.318 --> 07:35.989
And even pretend to
wipe away nonexistent tears!

07:35.989 --> 07:39.015
Geez! It makes me mad!

07:41.928 --> 07:44.097
That old geezer!

07:44.097 --> 07:46.666
- Hey, Masahiro.
- What?

07:46.666 --> 07:49.803
You should be more
agreeable sometimes.

07:49.803 --> 07:54.241
You learned everything you don't
know from Seimei, didn't you?

07:54.241 --> 07:56.877
It's true that everything
I know now...

07:56.877 --> 08:00.113
was taught by Grandfather
when I was a child.

08:00.113 --> 08:02.215
I was obedient then...

08:02.215 --> 08:05.048
so I listened well to
what Grandfather said.

08:05.585 --> 08:08.121
Seimei had a great influence
on your aim...

08:08.121 --> 08:10.681
to become an onmyouji,
hadn't he?

08:10.824 --> 08:13.894
When you put it this way,
I thought I made the decision...

08:13.894 --> 08:15.929
to become an onmyouji
on my own. But...

08:15.929 --> 08:18.799
Wait! Could Grandfather
have planned to...

08:18.799 --> 08:21.501
make me an onmyouji
right from the start?

08:21.501 --> 08:23.003
What do you mean?

08:23.003 --> 08:25.739
Grandfather must have
been very happy...

08:25.739 --> 08:29.276
when I said I wanted
to become an onmyouji...

08:29.276 --> 08:33.346
Grandfather may be just
playing around with me?!

08:33.346 --> 08:37.350
- Geez! I'm really mad!
- What's up with you?

08:37.350 --> 08:42.622
But why did Grandfather seal my
second sight when I was a kid?

08:42.622 --> 08:44.758
If he planned to make
me an onmyouji,

08:44.758 --> 08:47.461
there was no need to do that.

08:47.461 --> 08:51.231
The supernatural are afraid of
people with the second sight.

08:51.231 --> 08:54.301
It was possible that
they would kill you...

08:54.301 --> 08:56.169
before you could grow up.

08:56.169 --> 08:58.271
That's probably what
Seimei thought.

08:58.271 --> 09:02.605
Even so, he didn't have
to seal my second sight...

09:02.709 --> 09:08.248
- Because of that, I...
- It's fine. You can see again.

09:08.248 --> 09:10.341
Yes, you're right, but...

09:10.884 --> 09:15.789
At that time, I was always
following after Grandfather...

09:15.789 --> 09:18.458
and I rarely left the house too.

09:18.458 --> 09:20.858
Even without the second sight...

09:21.361 --> 09:26.560
That's right. It was around then
that I nearly fell into the pond.

09:28.969 --> 09:31.028
What?

09:31.505 --> 09:35.498
Hey, how did I end up
nearly falling into the pond?

09:41.882 --> 09:44.484
There was no one around then.

09:44.484 --> 09:46.850
But I nearly fell in.

09:52.158 --> 09:56.463
Before I knew it,
someone had saved me...

09:56.463 --> 09:59.666
Whoa, how could I
have forgotten that?!

09:59.666 --> 10:04.037
You were pushed by an
evil demon which had sneaked in.

10:04.037 --> 10:05.138
What?!

10:05.138 --> 10:09.743
Those things were afraid of you
even though you couldn't see them.

10:09.743 --> 10:13.702
That's why they wanted to get
rid of you while you were a kid.

10:14.447 --> 10:18.018
Don't go near the water.
You'll be pushed in.

10:18.018 --> 10:20.782
Mokkun... don't tell me...

10:21.421 --> 10:24.424
I heard about that
from Seimei.

10:24.424 --> 10:26.449
O-Oh, I see.

10:28.328 --> 10:30.897
But it was close!

10:30.897 --> 10:34.100
You could have already crossed
over to the netherworld.

10:34.100 --> 10:37.337
You've always been so helpless,
grandson of Seimei.

10:37.337 --> 10:39.737
Don't call me grandson!

10:47.147 --> 10:50.016
I thought you have given up
on reading the stars.

10:50.016 --> 10:53.420
What do you plan to do with
the divination board this time?

10:53.420 --> 10:57.457
I was thinking of using divination
to find out the cause of the fire.

10:57.457 --> 11:00.824
Surely the other onmyouji
are already doing that?

11:01.861 --> 11:05.298
What can you find out
even if you try divination now?

11:05.298 --> 11:07.200
That's true...

11:07.200 --> 11:08.802
If you want to do it,

11:08.802 --> 11:12.839
how about trying it on the
strange aura you felt that time?

11:12.839 --> 11:15.467
What? Oh, I see!

11:15.508 --> 11:18.945
You were the only one who
sensed that demonic presence.

11:18.945 --> 11:21.514
So you could try divining that.

11:21.514 --> 11:25.712
The demonic presence
instead of the fire? All right!

11:27.654 --> 11:31.191
- Do your best...
- Did you say something?

11:31.191 --> 11:32.954
It's nothing...

11:34.227 --> 11:40.291
You don't know it, but you
brought light into my life.

11:43.637 --> 11:47.774
Scary... scary... scary...
scary... scary... scary...

11:47.774 --> 11:51.301
- Scary... scary... scary...
- Here it comes.

12:06.393 --> 12:08.520
That's terrifying...

12:32.619 --> 12:37.056
I'm surprised it burned
all the way to that area.

12:37.190 --> 12:39.893
Geez... That's terrible.

12:39.893 --> 12:43.263
The wind was probably blowing
in the wrong direction.

12:43.263 --> 12:44.898
Even so...

12:44.898 --> 12:47.500
we still don't know
the cause of the fire.

12:47.500 --> 12:49.469
Lord Yukinari!

12:49.469 --> 12:51.137
- It's been quite a while.
- Masahiro.

12:51.137 --> 12:52.739
Hey! I said it's not this one!
- It's been quite a while.
- Masahiro.

12:52.739 --> 12:53.173
Hey! I said it's not this one!

12:53.173 --> 12:53.640
Hey! I said it's not this one!
I'm sorry that I haven't
been visiting you too.

12:53.640 --> 12:56.473
I'm sorry that I haven't
been visiting you too.

12:57.477 --> 12:59.779
I accepted my role
as your guardian,

12:59.779 --> 13:02.549
but I have been busy
with the work here.

13:02.549 --> 13:04.551
That's right!
And you said that...

13:04.551 --> 13:08.421
you'd faithfully carry out your
duty as Masahiro's guardian!

13:08.421 --> 13:12.790
Anyway, he can't hear
or see me!

13:13.126 --> 13:17.430
W-Well... thanks for
your concern.

13:17.430 --> 13:21.267
But it's more important to carry
out the repairs here now.

13:21.267 --> 13:23.903
We haven't made
much progress though.

13:23.903 --> 13:25.839
At this rate, I'm not
sure how long...

13:25.839 --> 13:28.508
it would take to restore it
to its original state.

13:28.508 --> 13:30.066
I see...

13:30.410 --> 13:32.345
It must be tough for you too.

13:32.345 --> 13:34.881
The work must be
carried out efficiently,

13:34.881 --> 13:34.948
The work must be
carried out efficiently,
P-Please do your best,
Lord Yukinari.

13:34.948 --> 13:38.284
and the culprit who set the fire
has yet to be caught too...
P-Please do your best,
Lord Yukinari.

13:38.284 --> 13:40.320
By the way, Masahiro,

13:40.320 --> 13:42.789
did you find out anything
about the cause of the fire?

13:42.789 --> 13:47.127
Oh... I-I have yet to
find out anything concrete.

13:47.127 --> 13:50.392
But I intend to continue
my investigation.

13:54.567 --> 13:59.038
You can't divine for one subject
more than once a day,

13:59.038 --> 14:03.943
because the initial result would
determine subsequent readings.

14:03.943 --> 14:06.246
Isn't that an established rule?

14:06.246 --> 14:08.578
That's the rule, but...

14:09.249 --> 14:11.151
If so, please follow the rule.

14:11.151 --> 14:12.719
Yes, you're right.

14:12.719 --> 14:17.223
If you still can't see results
after a few times, just give up.

14:17.223 --> 14:19.748
It's not that I didn't
get any results.

14:20.193 --> 14:23.185
- I don't understand the meaning.
- Meaning?

14:24.497 --> 14:26.766
There's something bad
somewhere in the town...

14:26.766 --> 14:31.137
That's probably what I sense.

14:31.137 --> 14:33.139
"Probably"?
What do you mean?

14:33.139 --> 14:38.338
There's something
unwanted, perhaps...

14:40.814 --> 14:42.975
Something unwanted?

14:45.485 --> 14:49.055
Geez, there's too much
that I don't know.

14:49.055 --> 14:51.224
- Hey, Mokkun...
- What is it?

14:51.224 --> 14:53.692
I'm thinking of going
out for a while.

14:56.029 --> 14:57.530
Where to?

14:57.530 --> 15:01.000
I'm thinking of asking someone
who knows more about this.

15:01.000 --> 15:03.833
- You mean Seimei?
- No way!

15:27.994 --> 15:29.859
Is that you, Tenitsu?

15:34.067 --> 15:36.194
What is your command?

15:37.003 --> 15:40.773
It's fine. After all,
he's with Masahiro...

15:40.773 --> 15:44.834
and will report to me if
things become troublesome.

15:48.081 --> 15:50.350
You came up with a good idea...

15:50.350 --> 15:52.585
asking the demons
who roam the night.

15:52.585 --> 15:55.288
If the fire was the
work of a demon,

15:55.288 --> 15:58.358
they might probably
know something.

15:58.358 --> 16:01.027
But how do you plan to
talk to them?

16:01.027 --> 16:03.429
I'd let them catch a glimpse
of my paper talisman...

16:03.429 --> 16:05.531
and prayer beads while
asking politely...

16:05.531 --> 16:10.127
Asking them? Isn't that
considered a threat?

16:10.770 --> 16:14.007
But I can't seem to find them
when you need them.

16:14.007 --> 16:17.043
Usually, they would be
swarming around here.

16:17.043 --> 16:20.376
Are they hiding from me
because of fear?

16:23.016 --> 16:24.918
What's wrong?

16:24.918 --> 16:27.910
I feel a prickling sensation...

16:31.424 --> 16:33.324
What's that?

16:39.132 --> 16:41.032
What is an ox doing here?

16:49.175 --> 16:51.234
Masahiro, what should we do?!

16:54.147 --> 16:57.317
- T-This is...
- Wh-What on earth is that?!

16:57.317 --> 16:59.148
I've never seen anything like it!

17:00.954 --> 17:03.479
I sensed this demonic
presence that time too...

17:06.726 --> 17:09.329
Masahiro, run!
What are you doing?!

17:09.329 --> 17:12.230
- I'm thinking!
- There's no time for that!

17:14.267 --> 17:15.825
Masahiro!

17:27.947 --> 17:31.184
Watch out, it's different from
the ones you have faced before.

17:31.184 --> 17:34.085
It's the same. I'm hoping
that it's the same!

17:38.157 --> 17:42.651
By the absolute god, fire emperor,
engulf the demon!

18:10.156 --> 18:11.714
Guren!

18:16.829 --> 18:18.524
Stay back.

18:40.453 --> 18:41.977
Go!

18:57.236 --> 18:59.939
Mokkun, you should have
transformed yourself earlier!

18:59.939 --> 19:02.567
I'm Guren when
I'm in this form.

19:09.182 --> 19:11.776
Guren's flames are hellfire...

19:11.951 --> 19:15.288
They would burn anything
and turn everything into ashes.

19:15.288 --> 19:19.987
The fire that burns in the
deepest darkness... But...

19:25.465 --> 19:27.933
Why isn't it burning up?!

19:29.802 --> 19:33.829
- What are you?!
- Give up that boy to me.

19:36.809 --> 19:39.712
- Answer me.
- Hand him over.

19:39.712 --> 19:43.850
The spiritual power hidden
within him is unrivalled.

19:43.850 --> 19:46.486
I will offer this prey
to my master.

19:46.486 --> 19:48.688
Offer Masahiro, you say?

19:48.688 --> 19:51.124
You! You're no ayakashi.

19:51.124 --> 19:54.787
You're a pathetic deity which
has fallen to serving a human.

19:54.927 --> 19:58.522
Indeed, I've become a human's
servant of my own will.

19:58.798 --> 20:03.169
But I don't have to be
lectured by the likes of you.

20:03.169 --> 20:07.128
You'll regret speaking
so rudely to me, Touda!

20:16.349 --> 20:17.976
Oh no...

20:19.152 --> 20:21.554
It can't be helped.

20:21.554 --> 20:24.352
I guess I'll offer this body.

20:28.761 --> 20:31.662
- It disappeared?
- W-Where did it go?

20:38.204 --> 20:41.696
Who did it want to
offer Masahiro to?

20:51.984 --> 20:53.653
What's wrong, Masahiro?

20:53.653 --> 20:57.757
It's somewhat different from
the ones we encountered before.

20:57.757 --> 21:01.394
You'll be laughed at for saying
that, Seimei's grandson.

21:01.394 --> 21:03.453
Don't call me grandson!

21:18.978 --> 21:23.783
A strange power has
arisen in the distant west.

21:23.783 --> 21:28.584
It seems a disaster
will soon befall men...

21:42.868 --> 21:54.247
I heard your voice inside
the deep darkness

21:54.247 --> 22:05.658
Just your phrase "I believe"
echoed in my heart

22:05.658 --> 22:11.464
You always stayed by my side

22:11.464 --> 22:16.993
You always gave me courage

22:19.272 --> 22:29.682
In order to continue
protecting our future

22:29.682 --> 22:36.389
I promise you, my beloved

22:36.389 --> 22:41.627
I won't give up

22:41.627 --> 22:47.433
I will keep overcoming my limits

22:47.433 --> 22:54.271
Surely surely surely

23:00.012 --> 23:02.640
Next Episode

23:23.769 --> 23:25.471
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.471 --> 23:26.806
Episode 4.

23:26.806 --> 23:26.839
Episode 4
Search for the Foreign Shadow
Episode 4.

23:26.839 --> 23:29.171
Episode 4
Search for the Foreign Shadow
Search for the Foreign Shadow.
